  "prefLabel": "Ncr 733.11 Amplified Audio",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 733.11 Amplified Audio. Park guests shall not conduct activities that will disturb other visitors’ quiet enjoyment of park properties pursuant to Ncr 733.03, including but not limited to the broadcasting of audio. Persons shall listen to audio using headphones, earbuds, and similar devices.\n\nSource. #14055 EMERGENCY, EXPIRED: 2-15-25\n\nNew. #14291, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr700.html"
